"One of the most active volcanoes in the world and the icon of La Fortuna."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1347
msgid ""
"El Arenal es un estratovolcán de 1 670 msnm; su última gran erupción fue en "
"1968."
msgstr ""
"Arenal is a 1,670 m stratovolcano; its last major eruption was in 1968."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1348
msgid ""
"Entre 1968 y 2010 mantuvo actividad casi permanente, con flujos de lava "
"visibles de noche."
msgstr ""
"Between 1968 and 2010 it was almost continuously active, with lava flows "
"visible at night."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1349
msgid ""
"Protege 12 124 hectáreas de bosque premontano y numerosa fauna: tucanes, "
"perezosos y coatíes."
msgstr ""
"It protects 12,124 hectares of premontane forest and abundant wildlife: "
"toucans, sloths and coatis."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1350
msgid ""
"Hay senderos como El Silencio y la colada de lava de 1968; el mirador del "
"lago es imperdible."
msgstr ""
"There are trails such as El Silencio and the 1968 lava flow; the lake "
"viewpoint is unmissable."

