msgstr "Soaking in the natural hot springs at the foot of the volcano"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1370
msgid "Canopy y puentes colgantes en la zona"
msgstr "Canopy tours and hanging bridges in the area"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1373
msgid "Lleva capa de lluvia: el clima es húmedo casi todo el año."
msgstr "Bring a rain layer: the climate is humid almost year round."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1374
msgid "Mejor visibilidad del cono por la mañana temprano."
msgstr "Best views of the cone early in the morning."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1375
msgid "Usa calzado cerrado con buen agarre para los senderos."
msgstr "Wear closed shoes with good grip for the trails."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1377
msgid ""
"Desde 2010 el volcán entró en reposo; el parque protege el bosque que se "
"regeneró sobre las coladas históricas."
msgstr ""
"Since 2010 the volcano has been dormant; the park protects the forest that "
"has regenerated over the historic lava flows."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1384
msgid ""
"La \"Amazonia de Costa Rica\": canales, selva y la mayor playa de anidación "
"de tortuga verde del Caribe."
msgstr ""
"The \"Amazon of Costa Rica\": canals, jungle and the Caribbean's largest "
"green turtle nesting beach."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1387
#: includes/data/destination-spot-corrections.php:31
msgid ""
"Es el sitio de anidación más importante del hemisferio para la tortuga verde "
"(Chelonia mydas)."
msgstr ""
"It is the hemisphere's most important nesting site for the green turtle "
"(Chelonia mydas)."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1388
#: includes/data/destination-spot-corrections.php:32
msgid ""
"Solo se llega por agua o por aire: no hay carretera hasta el pueblo de "
"Tortuguero."
msgstr ""
"It can only be reached by water or air: there is no road to the village of "
"Tortuguero."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1389
msgid ""
"Sus 31 187 ha protegen canales, lagunas y bosque húmedo tropical con 400 "
"especies de árboles."
msgstr ""
"Its 31,187 ha protect canals, lagoons and tropical rainforest with 400 tree "
"species."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1390
#: includes/data/destination-spot-corrections.php:33
msgid ""
"La temporada de desove va de julio a octubre; los tours nocturnos son "
"guiados y regulados."
msgstr ""
"The nesting season runs from July to October; night tours are guided and "
"regulated."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1392
