msgstr "An access permit is required: book in advance during high season."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1414
msgid "El parque no permite entrar con ganado: use repelente y ropa larga."
msgstr ""
"The park does not allow livestock entry: use repellent and long sleeves."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1415
msgid "Pague a guías autorizados dentro del parque."
msgstr "Pay only authorized guides inside the park."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1417
msgid ""
"Está conectado al Corredor Biológico Talamanca-Caribe y al Parque Nacional "
"Corcovado, formando uno de los mayores bloques de selva húmeda del mundo."
msgstr ""
"It is linked to the Talamanca-Caribbean Biological Corridor and Corcovado "
"National Park, forming one of the largest blocks of rainforest in the world."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1424
msgid ""
"Playas de arena blanca, acantilados y monos que bajan de los árboles: el "
"parque más visitado del país."
msgstr ""
"White-sand beaches, cliffs and monkeys coming down from the trees: the "
"country's most visited park."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1427
msgid ""
"Es el parque más visitado de Costa Rica y uno de los más pequeños con apenas "
"1 983 ha."
msgstr ""
"It is Costa Rica's most visited park and one of the smallest at just 1,983 "
"ha."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1428
msgid ""
"Cuenta con tres playas accesibles: Espadilla Sur, Manuel Antonio y Puerto "
"Escondido."
msgstr ""
"It has three accessible beaches: Espadilla Sur, Manuel Antonio and Puerto "
"Escondido."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1429
msgid ""
"Hogar de monos carablanca, tití y aulladores, además de perezosos de tres "
"dedos."
msgstr ""
"Home to white-faced, squirrel and howler monkeys, plus three-toed sloths."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1430
