msgid "No se permite estacionar fuera del estacionamiento con cupo."
msgstr "Parking outside the reserved spaces is not allowed."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1455
msgid "El mar es fuerte: lo seguro son largas caminatas, no el baño."
msgstr "The surf is strong: long walks are the safe option, not swimming."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1457
msgid ""
"A pesar de su tamaño reducido, concentra una densidad de especies "
"excepcional; su manejo busca compatibilizar el uso turístico con la "
"conservación."
msgstr ""
"Despite its small size it holds an exceptional species density; its "
"management works to balance tourism with conservation."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1464
msgid ""
"La joya de la Península de Osa: el bosque primario más extenso del Pacífico "
"centroamericano."
msgstr ""
"The jewel of the Osa Peninsula: the largest primary forest on the Central "
"American Pacific."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1467
msgid ""
"National Geographic lo llamó \"el lugar con mayor intensidad biológica del "
"planeta\" en bosque húmedo."
msgstr ""
"National Geographic called it \"the place with the greatest biological "
"intensity on the planet\" in rainforest."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1468
msgid ""
"Es el único lugar de Costa Rica donde coexisten las cuatro especies de monos "
"del país."
msgstr ""
"It is the only place in Costa Rica where all four of the country's monkey "
"species coexist."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1469
msgid ""
"Poblaciones importantes de tapir, puma, jaguar y la guacamaya roja se "
"refugian aquí."
msgstr ""
"Important populations of tapir, puma, jaguar and the scarlet macaw take "
"refuge here."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1470
msgid ""
"Se accede a pie desde Los Patos, de noche desde Drake o en avioneta; "
"requiere guía autorizado."
msgstr ""
"It is reached on foot from Los Patos, overnight from Drake or by light "
"aircraft; a licensed guide is required."

