msgid "Tip:"
msgstr "Tip:"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:499
msgid ""
"Costa Rica tiene el 6% de la biodiversidad mundial. Si te gusta la "
"naturaleza, probá \"Naturaleza\" y \"Senderismo\"; si preferís adrenalina, "
"\"Aventura\" y \"Náutico\". Combiná varios para un viaje más completo."
msgstr ""
"Costa Rica has 6% of the world's biodiversity. If you like nature, try "
"\"Nature\" and \"Hiking\"; if you prefer adrenaline, \"Adventure\" and "
"\"Water sports\". Combine several for a more complete trip."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:508
msgid "2. ¿Hacia dónde viajás?"
msgstr "2. Where are you heading?"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:509
msgid "Podés combinar varios destinos en un mismo itinerario."
msgstr "You can combine several destinations in one itinerary."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:515
msgid ""
"La Fortuna (volcán Arenal), Monteverde (bosque nuboso) y Manuel Antonio "
"(playa + fauna) son los clásicos. Para algo menos turístico, probá "
"Sarapiquí, Drake Bay o Tortuguero. Cada región tiene su propia magia."
msgstr ""
"La Fortuna (Arenal volcano), Monteverde (cloud forest) and Manuel Antonio "
"(beach + wildlife) are the classics. For something less touristy, try "
"Sarapiquí, Drake Bay or Tortuguero. Each region has its own magic."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:523
msgid "3. ¿Cuándo viajás?"
msgstr "3. When are you traveling?"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:524
msgid "Seleccioná las fechas de tu viaje."
msgstr "Select your travel dates."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:530
msgid ""
"Temporada seca (dic-abr): mejor clima pero más caro y concurrido. Temporada "
"verde (may-nov): lluvias por la tarde, paisajes exuberantes y precios más "
"bajos. Evitá Semana Santa y Navidad si buscás tranquilidad."
msgstr ""
"Dry season (Dec-Apr): better weather but more expensive and crowded. Green "
"season (May-Nov): afternoon rain, lush landscapes and lower prices. Avoid "
"Easter and Christmas if you want peace and quiet."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:534
msgid "Fecha de llegada"
msgstr "Arrival date"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:535 includes/class-transport-admin.php:376
msgid "Llegada"
msgstr "Arrival"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:537
msgid "Fecha de salida"
msgstr "Departure date"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:545
msgid "4. Presupuesto y tipo de servicio"
msgstr "4. Budget and service type"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:546
msgid "Dejá libre el rango si querés que te mostremos todo."
msgstr "Leave the range empty to see everything."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:552
msgid ""
"Costa Rica es un destino de gama media-alta. Un día de tour cuesta entre $50-"
"$150 por persona. Alojamiento: $60-$200/noche. Transporte privado: $80-$150. "
"Considerá que los precios incluyen guía y equipo en la mayoría de los tours."
msgstr ""
"Costa Rica is a mid-to-high-end destination. A tour day costs between $50-"
"$150 per person. Accommodation: $60-$200/night. Private transport: $80-$150. "
"Keep in mind that prices include a guide and equipment on most tours."

